---
// AIDLC Suite — editorial card style
---

<div class="aidlc-grid">

  <!-- VS Code Extension -->
  <div class="ac-card">
    <div class="ac-body">
      <h3 class="ac-title">AIDLC for VS Code</h3>
      <span class="ac-kind">VS Code Extension</span>
      <p class="ac-desc">Builder UI cho AI pipelines. Edit <code>workspace.yaml</code> visually, theo dõi run trong sidebar, và mở AIDLC Monitor cho token usage + live agent observability.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ac-footer">
      <a class="ac-link ac-link--primary" href="https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=hueanmy.aidlc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">&rarr;&nbsp;VS Code Marketplace</a>
      <a class="ac-link" href="https://open-vsx.org/extension/hueanmy/aidlc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open VSX</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- CLI -->
  <div class="ac-card">
    <div class="ac-body">
      <h3 class="ac-title">AIDLC CLI</h3>
      <span class="ac-kind">Terminal &middot; npm</span>
      <p class="ac-desc">Standalone engine — không cần VS Code. Scaffold workspaces, apply presets, drive runs end-to-end via Claude, và watch live từ shell.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ac-footer">
      <a class="ac-link ac-link--primary" href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/aidlc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">&rarr;&nbsp;npm install -g aidlc</a>
      <a class="ac-link" href="https://github.com/aidlc-io/aidlc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- AIDLC Term -->
  <div class="ac-card">
    <div class="ac-body">
      <h3 class="ac-title">AIDLC Term</h3>
      <span class="ac-kind">macOS &middot; Windows Beta &middot; Rust + wgpu</span>
      <p class="ac-desc">GPU-accelerated terminal cho agent work: file explorer theo shell, agent manager cho mọi Claude Code session, và live token-usage dashboard.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ac-footer">
      <a class="ac-link ac-link--primary" href="https://github.com/aidlc-io/aidlc-io.github.io/releases/download/term-v0.3.2/AIDLC-Term-0.3.2.dmg">&rarr;&nbsp;Download macOS</a>
      <a class="ac-link" href="https://github.com/aidlc-io/aidlc-io.github.io/releases/download/term-v0.3.2/AIDLC-Term-0.3.2-windows.zip">Windows (beta)</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- AIDLC TestAgent -->
  <div class="ac-card">
    <div class="ac-body">
      <h3 class="ac-title">AIDLC TestAgent</h3>
      <span class="ac-kind">CLI &middot; npm &middot; TypeScript</span>
      <p class="ac-desc">Open-source AI test agent cho web, desktop, API &amp; mobile. Point vào target, approve plan, nhận về test suite chạy được. Không telemetry, không cần API key.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ac-footer">
      <a class="ac-link ac-link--primary" href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/aidlc-testagent" target="_blank" rel="noopener">&rarr;&nbsp;npm install -g aidlc-testagent</a>
      <a class="ac-link" href="https://github.com/aidlc-io/aidlc-testagent" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<style>
  .aidlc-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .aidlc-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .ac-card {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 5%, var(--bg-card));
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 1.5rem 1.5rem 1.2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    transition: box-shadow 150ms ease;
  }
  .ac-card:hover { box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }

  .ac-body { flex: 1; margin-bottom: 1.1rem; }

  .ac-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--fg);
    margin: 0 0 0.3rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ac-kind {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
  }

  .ac-desc {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--fg-dim);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .ac-desc code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.82em;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 0.05em 0.3em;
  }

  .ac-footer {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .ac-link {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 120ms;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .ac-link:hover { color: var(--fg); }
  .ac-link--primary { color: var(--accent); }
  .ac-link--primary:hover { color: var(--accent-hover); }
</style>
